In response to everyone's requests, we have made the following adjustments to the game:

- Added the names of the speakers in the dialog history;
- Significantly increased the fast-forward speed and skipped cutscenes during fast-forwarding;
- Added an auto-save feature to avoid accidental loss of progress;
- Now, the dialog history can be viewed when player-choices appear;
- After viewing character information, players can now return to the player information screen;
- Added support for mouse wheel scrolling in the scrollbar;
- Adjusted the font to make it appear more refined;
- Optimized the file size of the DEMO.

(Please trigger the following three items by completing the last chapter of the DEMO)
- After completing the DEMO, players can unlock the ability to jump to specific chapters for reading;
- After completing the DEMO, players can unlock the status panel on the mainmenu;
- After completing the DEMO, players can unlock the music room.

Thank you for your love and support, please continue to support us!
